        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic asks GitHub for its latest release %@. Only public release information is read; nothing about your Mac or your minis is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic deletes it from your Keychain. To use it later, you'll need to paste it in again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic deletes it from your Keychain. To use it later, you'll need to paste it in again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic forgets how long your minis took, and uses its own figures until you've made a few more. Your minis are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic forgets how long your minis took, and uses its own figures until you've made a few more. Your minis are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic forgets its settings and saved keys, then opens again as it did the first time. Your minis are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic forgets its settings and saved keys, then opens again as it did the first time. Your minis are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic forgets its settings, tips and any saved AI keys, and shows the tour again. Your minis are kept.\n\nReset All also removes the 3D engine: first-launch setup shows again and downloads it again (%@ GB, depending on the 3D model)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic forgets its settings, tips and any saved AI keys, and shows the tour again. Your minis are kept.\n\nReset All also removes the 3D engine: first-launch setup shows again and downloads it again (%@ GB, depending on the 3D model)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic lists the slicers it finds on this Mac. The Mac's default app works with any other slicer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic lists the slicers it finds on this Mac. The Mac's default app works with any other slicer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic makes it print-ready at these sizes, %@. It has no picture, so it can be resized and duplicated, but not made again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic makes it print-ready at these sizes, %@. It has no picture, so it can be resized and duplicated, but not made again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic opens Draw Things when it needs it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic opens Draw Things when it needs it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic redraws it as a grey statue, which the 3D engine understands far better. Turn it off if your picture is already a grey 3D model, or to keep its colours for Export for Virtual Tabletop: the shape may come out less clean." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic redraws it as a grey statue, which the 3D engine understands far better. Turn it off if your picture is already a grey 3D model, or to keep its colours for Export for Virtual Tabletop: the shape may come out less clean."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mimic redraws the picture with this change and shows it to you before building the 3D shape" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mimic redraws the picture with this change and shows it to you before building the 3D shape"
          }
        }
