            "value" : "You can switch later in Settings → 3D Model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your description, or the picture to redraw, is sent to %@. Each picture Mimic draws or redraws is one paid request on your account: one for a description or a grey sculpt, plus one for each side picture it redraws. A picture used as it is costs nothing. The key is kept in your Mac's Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your description, or the picture to redraw, is sent to %@. Each picture Mimic draws or redraws is one paid request on your account: one for a description or a grey sculpt, plus one for each side picture it redraws. A picture used as it is costs nothing. The key is kept in your Mac's Keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
